# Azure MSAL Authentication Configuration - Azure AD B2C
# Copy these values to Vercel Environment Variables

# Required: Azure AD B2C Client ID (Application ID)
VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=66ab04e3-a85d-48f1-b7a9-db7fdedd5e9d

# Required: B2C Tenant Name (the part before .onmicrosoft.com)
